@startuml
title BLE transport (before application authentication)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
participant "Pi Rust app\nBlueR" as app
participant "Pi BlueZ\nLinux Bluetooth stack" as stack
participant "Foreground phone\nGATT client / central" as phone
app -> stack : D-Bus: register custom GATT service\nand advertise as peripheral
stack -> phone : Advertising (service UUID)
phone -> stack : Connect; exchange ATT MTU
phone -> stack : Discover service and characteristics
phone -> stack : Write CCCD: enable indications
stack -> app : Subscription ready
phone -> stack : ATT write request: chunk toward Pi
stack -> app : Write callback; validate/enqueue chunk
app --> stack : Write result
stack --> phone : ATT write response
app -> stack : Indicate chunk toward phone
stack -> phone : ATT indication
phone --> stack : ATT confirmation
note over app, phone
Each write/indication carries a bounded chunk.
ATT confirmation is transport-level only.
Application records have no receipt or retry.
Transport completion leaves delivery unconfirmed.
end note
@enduml
